        "teacherMoves": "Say: \"Which question on our board did today's evidence help to answer? Write a new question that today's results raise.\" Give 10 seconds WAIT TIME, then 2 minutes to write. Cold-call 3 learners to post a note and say which category it belongs to. Point out that questions about what salts are used for will be taken up in Lesson 7. Allow about 4 minutes.",
        "sensemakingStrategy": "Driving Question Board tracking: linking new evidence to the class's own questions keeps the phenomenon in focus and shows progress.",
